                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "We are less than two weeks away from a health care crisis in this country, with premiums set to skyrocket, and Republicans refuse to work towards a solution.\n\nThat\u2019s why I voted NO for the 12th time against their partisan budget bill.\n\nRepublicans must negotiate now.",
