                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Coloradans who purchase health insurance through the ACA marketplace may see their premiums double or triple next year. This is unacceptable.\n\nHigher premiums will force working families across the state to choose between health care and other necessities like groceries or rent.\n\nAnd yet, Republicans refuse to extend this critical lifeline.",
